  "implementation": [
    "Preserve the R18 low shores, connected mainland route, true soil-rooting, millimetre needles and attached branching cherry trees.",
    "A single physical0.53-degree solar disk has five shadowed quadrature samples, coupled sky/reflection RGB and integrated radiance, and an explicitly excluded analytic disk during all indirect captures.",
    "True world-path valley air replaces uniform near fog; sunlight/sky transport is applied before tone mapping, with no fullscreen color filter or fake rays.",
    "Neutral ceramic albedo, existing glaze micro-normal/roughness/weight, physical lacquer and existing gilt microfields change actual PBR response.",
    "Upper ridge, gable and tile courses follow one fixed real oblique roof plan over the unchanged eave boundary. Narrower upper storey, its roof opening, ceiling and supports follow that geometry.",
    "Eight actual native captures now place the four hall probes inside real rooms/porches rather than outside the courtyard.",
    "Whole column-cap and seat footprints are fitted to the roof; receivers are densely sampled and split at gable jumps; friezes/plaque hang below actual roof.",
    "Whole closed hip-rafter sections fit beneath adjoining deck faces, fixing the two remaining R21 red roof slits."
  ],
